            <div type="translation" xml:lang="en" resp="#AA">
                <p>
                    Column A: To Poppaea Augusta, [wife of] Nero Caesar Augustus Germanicus
                    Column B: To Nero Claudius Caesar Augustus Germanicus, son of the divine Claudius, grandson of Germanicus Caesar, great-grandson of Tiberius Caesar Augustus, great-great-grandson of the divine Augustus, pontifex maximus, bearer of tribunician power for the 9th time, imperator for the 9th time, consul for the 4th.
                    Columm C: [To the Divine Claudia?], [daughter of Nero Augustus?], [virgin?] [---]
                    Footer: Lucius Titinius Glaucus Lucretianus, son of Lucius, of the tribe Galeria, duovir for the 4th time, appointed quinquennalis first by the favour of the Deified Claudius, prefect of Nero Claudius Caesar Augustus, patron of the colony, sevir of the Roman equites, curio for performing sacred rites, flamen of Roma [and] flamen of Augustus, appointed by the favour of Caesar, military tribune of the 22nd Legion Primigenia, prefect of the Balaeric Islands.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div type="commentary">
                <p>This is the same Lucius Titinius Glaucus Lucretianus as in <ref target="EmpWor000476">EmpWor000476</ref> from Luna (It. VII), <ref target="EmpWor000475">EmpWor000475</ref> that is probably also from Luna (It. VII), and in CIL 11.1332 and CIL 11,1349a (both from Luna, It. VII). He may also be attested in <ref target="EmpWor000451">EmpWor000451</ref> from Cosa (It. VII).</p> 
            </div>
